[M31_PA_Coil X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Coil"
LocFlyOverText="Coil"
LocLongDescription="The <Ability:ClassName> coils its body tightly, increasing its defense and dodge until the start of the next turn, gaining an additional action point on the next turn, and making the first non-movement action non-turn-ending. Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown>-turn cooldown."
LocHelpText="Increase defense and dodge, gain an additional action point on the next turn, and make the first non-movement action non-turn-ending."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Can be used without cover.<br><Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown>-turn cooldown.<br><Bullet> Increases defense by <Ability:M31_PA_Coil_DefenseBonus> and dodge by <Ability:M31_PA_Coil_DodgeBonus> until the start of the next turn. The bonus is doubled if the <Ability:ClassName> has lower cover against the attack, or trippled if the cover is high.<br><Bullet> Certain abilities, like <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Pinpoint</font> and <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Defensive Coil</font>, will still end the turn.<br><Bullet> Allows the use of <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Defensive Coil</font>.<br><Bullet> <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Defensive Coil</font> gives the same defensive bonuses, has no cooldown, and can be used while on fire or disoriented.<br><Bullet> <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Defensive Coil</font> can be activated by <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Deep Cover</font>."

[M31_PA_Coil_Hunker X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Defensive Coil"
LocFlyOverText="Defensive Coil"
LocLongDescription="The <Ability:ClassName> coils its body tightly, increasing its defense and dodge until the start of the next turn."
LocHelpText="Increase defense and dodge until the start of the next turn."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Can be used without cover.<br><Bullet> Increases defense by <Ability:M31_PA_Coil_DefenseBonus> and dodge by <Ability:M31_PA_Coil_DodgeBonus> until the start of the next turn. The bonus is doubled if the <Ability:ClassName> has lower cover against the attack, or trippled if the cover is high."

[M31_PA_Entwine X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Entwine"
LocFlyOverText="Entwine"
LocLongDescription="Increases <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Tongue Grab</font>'s aim by <Ability:M31_PA_Entwine_AimBonus> and <Ability:M31_FontAbility>bind</font> damage by <Ability:M31_PA_Entwine_BindDamageBonus>. Additionaly, gain +<Ability:M31_PA_Entwine_DefenseBonus> defense while binding an enemy."
LocHelpText="Increases <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Tongue Grab</font>'s aim by <Ability:M31_PA_Entwine_AimBonus> and <Ability:M31_FontAbility>bind</font> damage by <Ability:M31_PA_Entwine_BindDamageBonus>. Additionaly, gain +<Ability:M31_PA_Entwine_DefenseBonus> defense while binding an enemy."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Defense and damage bonuses apply to all types of Bind."

[M31_PA_Lockjaw X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Lockjaw"
LocFlyOverText="Lockjaw"
LocLongDescription="Free bite attack against any enemies that enter, exit or attack from melee range during the enemy turn. Poisons and <font color='#1abc9c'>stuns</font> the target for <Ability:M31_PA_Lockjaw_StunDuration> action(s). Cannot target robots."
LocHelpText="Free bite attack against any enemies that enter, exit or attack from melee range during the enemy turn. Poisons and <font color='#1abc9c'>stuns</font> the target for <Ability:M31_PA_Lockjaw_StunDuration> action(s). Has a <Ability:M31_PA_Lockjaw_Cooldown> turn cooldown, but only when the attack successfuly hits. Cannot target robots."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Deals <Ability:M31_PA_Lockjaw_Damage> damage, poisons, and <font color='#1abc9c'>stuns</font> the target for <Ability:M31_PA_Lockjaw_StunDuration> action(s).<br><Bullet> Counts as reaction fire and cannot crit.<br><Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_PA_Lockjaw_Cooldown> turn cooldown, but only on a successful (graze or hit) attack.<br><Bullet> Only one attempt can made against each target per turn.<br><Bullet> Will not activate during the soldier's own turn.<br><Bullet> The poison is affected by <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Enhanced Poison</font>.<br><Bullet> Cannot target robots."

