LocHelpText="Free bite attack against any enemies that enter, exit or attack from melee range during the enemy turn. Poisons and <font color='#1abc9c'>stuns</font> the target for <Ability:M31_PA_Lockjaw_StunDuration> action(s). Has a <Ability:M31_PA_Lockjaw_Cooldown> turn cooldown, but only when the attack successfuly hits. Cannot target robots."

