[M31_PA_ViperBite X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Vicious Bite"
LocFlyOverText="Vicious Bite"
LocLongDescription="Bite any enemy within blue movement range. Deals damage, inflicts poison, and ruptures the target. Costs a single action and doesn't end the turn. Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown>-turn cooldown. Cannot target robots and environmental objects."
LocHelpText="Bite any enemy within blue movement range. Deals damage, inflicts poison, and ruptures the target. Cannot target robots."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Deals <Ability:M31_PA_ViperBite_Damage> points of damage and <Ability:M31_PA_ViperBite_Rupture> points of Rupture. Can crit for +<Ability:M31_PA_ViperBite_CritDamage> damage.<br><Bullet> Vicious Bite has innate +<Ability:M31_PA_ViperBite_AimBonus> aim and +<Ability:M31_PA_ViperBite_CritBonus> critical chance.<br><Bullet> The poison is the same as Poison Spit's and is affected by <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Enhanced Poison</font>.<br><Bullet> Cannot target robots and environmental objects."

[M31_PA_IronskinBite X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Ironskin Bite"
LocFlyOverText="Ironskin Bite"
LocLongDescription="Not-so-gently bite an adjacent ally, giving them <Ability:M31_PA_IronskinBite_ShieldAmount> points of ablative HP for <Ability:M31_PA_IronskinBite_Duration> turn(s). Costs a single action and doesn't end the turn. Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown>-turn cooldown. Cannot target robots."
LocHelpText="Bite an adjacent ally, giving them <Ability:M31_PA_IronskinBite_ShieldAmount> points of ablative HP for <Ability:M31_PA_IronskinBite_Duration> turn(s)."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Shield priority: <Ability:M31_PA_IronskinBite_ShieldPriority>.<br><Bullet> Shields with higher priority will be depleted first."

[M31_PA_RegenBite X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Regenerative Bite"
LocFlyOverText="Regenerative Bite"
LocLongDescription="Not-so-gently bite an adjacent ally. Applies regeneration, healing <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_HealPerTurn> HP per turn for <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_Duration> turn(s). Has <Ability:M31_SelfCharges> charge(s) per mission."
LocHelpText="Not-so-gently bite an adjacent ally. Applies regeneration, healing <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_HealPerTurn> HP per turn for <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_Duration> turn(s)."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown>-turn cooldown and <Ability:M31_SelfCharges> charge(s) per mission.<br><Bullet> If <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Enhanced Poison</font> is learned, regeneration will heal <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_EnhHealPerTurn> HP per turn for <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_EnhDuration> turn(s).<br><Bullet> Can be used to stabilize bleeding out soldiers: <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_bStabilize>.<br><Bullet> Cures poison: <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_bRemovePoison>. Provides poison immunity for the duration: <Ability:M31_PA_RegenBite_bProvidesPoisonImmunity>.<br><Bullet> Can target Vipers: <Ability:M31_PA_ViperBite_bCanTargetVipers>.<br><Bullet> Cannot target robots."

[M31_PA_MemeBite X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="\"Acid\" Bite"
LocFlyOverText="\"Acid\" Bite"
LocLongDescription="Viciously bite an adjacent unit, inflicting \"acid\". Can be used against allies and enemies alike. Has <Ability:M31_SelfCharges> charge(s) per mission."
LocHelpText="Not-so-gently bite and adjacent unit, inflicting \"acid\". Can be used against allies and enemies alike."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Allied units gain massive stat bonuses to aim, crit chance, dodge, mobility and will, as well as immunity to some mental status effects for <Ability:M31_PA_MemeBite_E> turn(s), but will take a small amount of damage whenever the effect ticks. Watch out for the side effects!<br><Bullet> Hostile units take damage and suffer a variety of extremely potent status effects.<br><Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown>-turn cooldown and <Ability:M31_SelfCharges> charge(s) per mission.<br><Bullet> Cannot target robots.<br><br><font color='#909497'>\"Are you sure this is the right acid?\"</font>"

[M31_PA_MemeBite_Panic X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="\"Acid\" Bite"
LocFlyOverText="\"Acid\" Bite"


[M31_PA_PoisonSpit X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Poison Spit"
LocFlyOverText="Poison Spit"
LocLongDescription="Spit deadly toxin that poisons all targets within the area. Does not leave a cloud. Costs a single action and doesn't end the turn. Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown>-turn cooldown."
LocHelpText="Spit deadly toxin that poisons any targets within the area. Does not leave a cloud."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> The poison deals <Ability:M31_PA_Poison_Damage> of the target's max HP (rounded up) damage per turn.<br><Bullet> Damage based on max HP is reduced to <Ability:M31_FontGold>1</font> against the Chosen and Alien Rulers.<br><Bullet> The poison reduces mobility by <Ability:M31_PA_Poison_MobilityPenalty> and aim by <Ability:M31_PA_Poison_AimPenalty>.<br><Bullet> The poison lasts for <Ability:M31_PA_Poison_Duration> turn(s).<br><Bullet> The poison is affected by <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Enhanced Poison</font>.<br><Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_PA_PoisonSpit_Radius> radius."

[M31_PA_EnhancedPoison X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Enhanced Poison"
LocFlyOverText="Enhanced Poison"
LocLongDescription="Improves the <Ability:ClassName>'s poison, increasing its duration, damage per turn, and aim and mobility penalties."
LocHelpText="Improves the <Ability:ClassName>'s poison, increasing its duration, damage per turn, and aim and mobility penalties."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Enhanced poison deals <Ability:M31_PA_EnhancedPoison_Damage> of the target's max HP (rounded up) damage per turn.<br><Bullet> Damage based on max HP is reduced to <Ability:M31_FontGold>1</font> against the Chosen and Alien Rulers.<br><Bullet> Enhanced poison reduces mobility by <Ability:M31_PA_EnhancedPoison_MobilityPenalty> and aim by <Ability:M31_PA_EnhancedPoison_AimPenalty>.<br><Bullet> Enhanced poison lasts for <Ability:M31_PA_EnhancedPoison_Duration> turn(s)."

[M31_PA_BlindingPoison X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Blinding Poison"
LocFlyOverText="Blinding Poison"
LocLongDescription="Improves the <Ability:ClassName>'s poison, causing it to blind the target for the same duration. Blinded untis have reduced sight range."
LocHelpText="Improves the <Ability:ClassName>'s poison, causing it to blind the target for the same duration. Blinded untis have reduced sight range."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> The poison blinds the targets for <Ability:M31_PA_Poison_Duration> turn(s).<br><Bullet> Enhanced poison blinds the targets for <Ability:M31_PA_EnhancedPoison_Duration> turn(s)."

[M31_PA_NeuroPoison X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Neurotoxin"
LocFlyOverText="Neurotoxin"
LocLongDescription="Improves the <Ability:ClassName>'s poison, causing it to disorient the targets on initial application. Reduces the cooldown of <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Poison Spit</font> by <Ability:M31_PA_NeuroPoison_CooldownReduction> turn(s)."
LocHelpText="Improves the <Ability:ClassName>'s poison, causing it to disorient the targets on initial application. Reduces the cooldown of <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Poison Spit</font> by <Ability:M31_PA_NeuroPoison_CooldownReduction> turn(s)."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Enhanced poison does not affect the duration of this effect.<br><Bullet> Does not disorient enemies immune to poison."


[M31_PA_FrostSpit X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Bitterfrost Spit"
LocFlyOverText="Bitterfrost Spit"
LocLongDescription="Project a blast of frost at long range that explodes into a chilling cloud. Deals <Ability:M31_PA_FrostSpit_Damage> points of frost damage and inflicts bitterfrost. Costs a single action and doesn't end the turn. Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown>-turn cooldown."
LocHelpText="Project a blast of frost at long range that explodes into a chilling cloud. Deals frost damage and inflicts bitterfrost."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_PA_FrostSpit_Radius> radius."

[M31_PA_FrostbiteSpit X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Frostbite Spit"
LocFlyOverText="Frostbite Spit"
LocLongDescription="Allows <Ability:M31_FontAbility>Bitterfrost Spit</font> to ignore armor and inflict critical damage (<Ability:M31_PA_FrostbiteSpit_CritBonus> for +<Ability:M31_PA_FrostbiteSpit_CritDamageBonus> damage)."
LocHelpText="<Ability:M31_FontAbility>Bitterfrost Spit</font> ignores armor and has a <Ability:M31_PA_FrostbiteSpit_CritBonus> chance to inflict +<Ability:M31_PA_FrostbiteSpit_CritDamageBonus> critical damage."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Critical chance is not affected by normal critical chance modifiers."

[M31_PA_FrostBreath X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Frost Breath"
LocFlyOverText="Frost Breath"
LocLongDescription="Project an icy blast that instantly freezes enemies in place. Costs a single action and doesn't end the turn. Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown>-turn cooldown and <Ability:M31_SelfCharges> charge(s) per mission."
LocHelpText="Project an icy blast that instantly freezes enemies in place."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Has the same range as other spit attacks (<Ability:M31_PA_ViperSpit_Range> tiles).<br><Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_PA_FrostBreath_Radius> radius."
